"""Default platform notification templates seeded for the Template Center.

Wording rule (Home Services direct-pay model): use "Pay the remaining amount
directly to the provider" — never "platform payment received"/"provider
payout initiated"/"wallet cash deducted" (usage credits are internal platform
credits, not real money; see Trust & Quality / Tenant 360 business rules).
"""

